{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國防相施卓添（Wes Streeting）周四（22日）警告，英國可能隨時面臨出於「國家支持的恐怖主義」或是極端天氣而引發的生活大亂情況，呼籲國民必須趕緊未雨綢繆，當局並建立網站（連結按此），教導大眾如何準備。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T08:23:48.685030+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:42:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T11:18:09.015795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:18:03.411304+00:00","content_hash":"c0cce1cb6023fa4aada8780442a0ef0db9ce3b541f77778d83284bfe282af94a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}